s in social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking to Strangers ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you are traveling, you meet new people. When you meet new people (strangers), you use the expression <span class=\"italic\">Nice to meet you. </span><br><br> When you talk to strangers, use <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">small talk </span></span>(informal chat about the weather, the city you are in, or general details about you). </span> <br><br>You can also ask questions that start with Wh- words like:", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Wh- Word\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Who\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Who is that?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" What\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" What do you do?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" When\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" When does it start?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Where\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Where are you from?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" How\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" How about you?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "boat tour ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a short trip through a place to see it by boat", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm going to take a boat tour of Paris this afternoon.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to describe places in a city. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "central ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in the middle of an area ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Louvre is a central landmark in Paris.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "on your left", "type": "name"}, {"content": "use to say something is located on the left side", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The building on your left is the city hall.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "former", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having a role in the past", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This was the former residence of the royal family.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cathedral ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the main church of an area", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Here is the famous cathedral of Paris.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "royal palace", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the official home of a king or queen", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Conciergerie was the former royal palace.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to design", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make a drawing of something that is going to be built", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Eiffel Tower was designed by Stephen Sauvestre.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "complex ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a group of buildings", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: On your left is an old complex.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob09aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "military", "type": "name"}, {"content": "relating to the army", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Les Invalides was the former military complex.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob09aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Choose any city in the world.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go on the Internet and find 5 places in that city.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a sentence about each of the places.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the sentences aloud to your class.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I choose a city.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe places in the city.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I speak clearly.", "type": "text"}]}]}